  "description": "CloudFront edge for appointment.tb-dev.thunderbird.dev. All AWS/CloudFront metrics are us-east-1 only, so every query overrides the region on the eu-central-1-default tb-dev CloudWatch datasource. Cache Hit Rate and Origin Latency require the per-distribution MonitoringSubscription (platform-infrastructure #826, Pulumi half) and are empty until it exists.",
